🗂️ Task Management System

A full-stack Task Management web application built using Python, Django, React.js, and MySQL.  
This application helps users manage tasks efficiently with authentication and status tracking.

🚀 Features

- User authentication using JWT
- Create, update, delete tasks
- Task status tracking (To Do, In Progress, Completed)
- Role-based access control
- RESTful APIs using Django REST Framework
- Responsive UI using React.js
- MySQL database integration

 🛠️ Tech Stack

*Frontend:** React.js, HTML5, CSS3  
*Backend:** Python, Django, Django REST Framework  
*Database:** MySQL  
*Authentication:** JWT  
*Tools:** Git, GitHub, Postman, VS Code  
